#: includes/integrations/mcp-integration.php:229
msgid ""
"Campaigns with their progress: goal, money raised, percent funded, number "
"of backers, end date, days left, state (active, funded, ended, pending, "
"disabled), whether they still accept contributions, reward count and "
"creator. Filter by state, name or \"ends within N days\"; sort by newest, "
"most raised, ending first or percent funded. Use the IDs with "
"crowdfunding-get-campaign and crowdfunding-list-backers."
msgstr ""

#: includes/integrations/mcp-integration.php:235
