#: includes/integrations/mcp-integration.php:1071
#. translators: 1: first day, 2: last day.
msgid ""
"Review my crowdfunding campaigns from %1$s to %2$s.\n"
"\n"
"Use the Crowdfunding tools:\n"
"1. crowdfunding-overview with after and before set to that period: money "
"raised, contributions, supporters and average against the period before, "
"campaign states and success rate.\n"
"2. crowdfunding-list-campaigns with state active, orderby progress, every "
"page.\n"
"3. crowdfunding-ending-soon with days 30 to see which campaigns are behind "
"pace.\n"
"4. crowdfunding-list-backers for the two campaigns that raised the most, to "
"see who backs them and which rewards they pick.\n"
"\n"
"Then write a short review for the store owner:\n"
"- Headline: raised, contributions, supporters and average contribution, "
"with the change against the previous period in percent.\n"
"- Best and weakest campaigns, with raised against goal and backers.\n"
"- Campaigns at risk: what they still need, per day, against their pace so "
"far.\n"
"- Rewards that sell out or nobody picks.\n"
"- Up to three concrete actions (for example extend a deadline, add a reward "
"tier, promote a campaign).\n"
"Use the store currency, round money to 2 decimals and keep it under 300 "
"words. Say plainly when there were no contributions."
msgstr ""

